{"3168600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Among Us 3D", "steam_appid": 3168600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive social deduction party game in three dimensions! <i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting — now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Classic gameplay, play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open — someone could be lurking right around the corner. Can you and the crew survive?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage, deceive, and kill all Crewmates! Sneak through vents, craft the perfect lie, frame the innocent, and survive at any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Crewmate tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch things up with Roles, Tag Mode, and Custom Lobbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add even more Roles into the mix with fan-favorites like the vent-using Engineer from the original <i>Among Us</i> or some <i>AU3D </i>exclusives, such as the vengeful Wraith or justice-seeking Vigilante! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tag Mode, it’s Infected versus Crewmates. The Infected try to catch and infect all Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with other Crewmates — including <i>Among Us 3D: VR</i> players! — with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with personalized gameplay, comfort, and moderation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>— Setup private lobbies with your friends without needing external chatting apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive social deduction party game in three dimensions! <i>Among Us 3D </i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved classic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting — now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Classic gameplay, play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open — someone could be lurking right around the corner. Can you and the crew survive?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage, deceive, and kill all Crewmates! Sneak through vents, craft the perfect lie, frame the innocent, and survive at any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Crewmate tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch things up with Roles, Tag Mode, and Custom Lobbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add even more Roles into the mix with fan-favorites like the vent-using Engineer from the original <i>Among Us</i> or some <i>AU3D </i>exclusives, such as the vengeful Wraith or justice-seeking Vigilante! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tag Mode, it’s Infected versus Crewmates. The Infected try to catch and infect all Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/9f5fcffe9acd3647a0ca5f733a2743e2.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobby up and connect with other Crewmates — including <i>Among Us 3D: VR</i> players! — with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with personalized gameplay, comfort, and moderation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D </i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/26fbdb32736c6c77965ca6fc9b226204.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.poster.avif?t=1775581014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.webm?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168600/extras/00ff799096a90e19135a0bca6096f5c8.mp4?t=1775581014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.<br>— Setup private lobbies with your friends without needing external chatting apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Express yourself through your hands with the all-new Gesture system.</p>", "short_description": "The definitive social deduction party game in three dimensions! Can the Crewmates survive, or will Impostors take over? Roles, Emergency Meetings, deception, sabotages, tasks: enjoy your favorite brand of chaos from the original Among Us with a 3D twist.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America,